{
    //Dynamic Tokens
    "Name.Suki": "Suki",
    "Name.Lotti": "Lotti",

    //Config
    "config.Blue-Haired Children.name": "Blue-Haired Children",
    "config.Blue-Haired Children.description": "When married to Ivaras, toggles whether the babies will have blue hair or not.",

    //NPC Name
    "DisplayName": "Ivaras",

    //Gift tastes
    "IvarasWolfgang.love": "You know me better than I thought. I love this, thank you!",
    "IvarasWolfgang.like": "Glad to see I’ve been on your mind. Thanks for thinking of me!",
    "IvarasWolfgang.dislike": "Oh... Interesting. I don’t know what to do with this, sorry...$6",
    "IvarasWolfgang.hate": "I can’t with this. Next time, just… don’t.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.neutral": "Thanks, I guess. I can figure something out for this.",

    //Ivaras dialogue
    "Ivaras.Introduction": "Wait, wait, wait, don’t tell me... it’s @, right? I’ve heard lots about you, thanks to my mentor. The energies have been quietly humming, awaiting your arrival.",
    "Ivaras.divorced": "Please, leave me be. It hurts enough to lose a ${husband^wife}$, but I lost my closest friend, too. It can’t be undone.$2",
    "Ivaras.breakUp": "I... I don’t know what to say. I still... Nevermind. I need to be alone for a while. Bye, @...$2",
    "Ivaras.secondchance_Boys": "What you did really hurt me, @. I need you to promise you’ll never do it again.$2#$b#...Lucky for you, I forgive easily. I’m willing to give you a second chance.$6",
    "Ivaras.dumped_Boys": "Please, I don't want to talk to you. Go away.$5",
    "Ivaras.DumpsterDiveComment": "...@? What are you doing in there? Come on, get out of the trash, please.$5",
    "Ivaras.HitBySlingshot": "Not cool! Cut that out!$5",
    "Ivaras.SpouseStardrop": "I want to help you in any way I can, so I sought out this special fruit. Its health benefits are far from our comprehension. Please savor it.$4",
    "Ivaras.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "I really can’t live in messy conditions, @. We seriously need to get this figured out.$5",
    "Ivaras.SpouseGiftJealous": "Hey, @... Did you gift {1} to {0}..?$3#$b#I, uh... I think I’m just feeling a little jealous. I didn’t mean to come off as accusing or anything. I’m sorry.$2",
    "Ivaras.SpouseMonstersInHouse": "How did a monster get in here?! Is there a weak spot in my warding barrier?!$8",
    "Ivaras.FlowerDance_Decline": "Sorry, I can’t accept. It’s not you, it’s just... those outfits are ridiculous.$3",
    "Ivaras.FlowerDance_Accept": "Ah, screw it. Let's do this, @. All I ask is that you don't judge my dancing.$1",
    "Ivaras.FlowerDance_Accept_Spouse": "Aw, man...How can I say no to you?$9",
    "Ivaras.AcceptBouquet": "You... you want to go out with me? Of course I feel the same! I never thought I’d have a chance, to be honest.$4",
    "Ivaras.RejectBouquet": "Oh, um... Sorry, @, I don't think I'm ready for a relationship yet.$6",
    "Ivaras.RejectBouquet_AlreadyAccepted": "Wow, a second bouquet? You must really like me, huh?$9",
    "Ivaras.RejectBouquet_AlreadyAccepted_Engaged": "I think we’re beyond that now, silly @. I’m already yours.$9",
    "Ivaras.RejectBouquet_AlreadyAccepted_Married": "How nostalgic. I recall vividly the first time you gave me one of these. I still remember the blush dusting your cheeks...$4",
    "Ivaras.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "Woah, woah, woah... I'm already a married man! No thank you.$8",
    "Ivaras.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "Er... Is this a joke?$6#$b#I barely know you.$3",
    "Ivaras.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "Uh..!$8#$b#Listen, @, I'm not one to rush these kinds of things. Let's get to know each other first, okay?$6",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant": "I’m so sorry, @, I really can’t...$2",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_AlreadyAccepted_Engaged": "I think I only have enough room on my neck for one of these, love.$9",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_AlreadyAccepted_Married": "Those are expensive. How do you keep getting your hands on them?$8",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_AlreadyAccepted": "Did you think I wasn’t satisfied with one? You are very sweet, @, but please, no need to spend so much coin on me.$8",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Look, I'm flattered, but I can't say yes. I'm loyal to {0}.$6",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "I'm not trying to be a homewrecker, @. No thanks.$5",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "You know what you want already?! We are NOT on that level yet, @.$8",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "Look, I get it. I want that too, but let's give it some time. I don't think we should jump into things we're not ready for.$6",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "...It's still not been enough time yet. I'm glad you're excited, at least. We'll get there soon.$6",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "Shouldn't we wait until there's a bit more space in the farmhouse?$6#$b#I adore you, I promise, I just don't think we should jump in without preparing first.",
    "Ivaras.dating_IvarasWolfgang_memory_oneday": "Hehe... You're mine now. I can barely wrap my head around it.$4",
    "Ivaras.dating_IvarasWolfgang_memory_oneyear": "Honey, guess what? We've been dating for a year now. How cool is that?$1",
    "Ivaras.GreenRain": "I feel so energetic today! That green rain sure is something. [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] tells me that it is a rare and most vital occurrence.#$b#It’s like Mother Nature’s spa day, in simple terms.",
    "Ivaras.GreenRain_2": "Hopefully the villagers are more at ease, knowing the rain is not a threat. Maybe it’ll spark curiosity in some. There’s magic right in front of them, if they choose to see it.",
    "Ivaras.GreenRainFinished": "And just like that, it’s over. It’ll be a while until it happens again, so I hope you utilized the day.",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)StardropTea": "Mmm... this smells nice. I don’t get to drink this often since it’s a rare blend. Thank you so much!",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)395": "Hehe, thanks for this. How'd you know I was feeling tired?$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)637": "They're messy to crack open, but it's so worth it for the seeds. Thank you so much for this!$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)104": "Whoa, sparkly... This is cool. I like unique jewelry, so thank you!$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)635": "Nice, an orange! I love the citrus, but I wish the smell didn't stick to my hands for so long after peeling them. Thank you, @.$1",
    "Ivaras.RejectItem(O)800": "It's so... ugly. Please, just put that thing away. I don't wanna touch it.$5",
    "Ivaras.RejectGift_Divorced": "I don't need anything from you. Leave me alone.$5",
    "Ivaras.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "That's just cruel, @.$5",
    "Ivaras.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "Did you think I forgot about what happened? I don't feel like starting over again.$5",
    "Ivaras.WipedMemory": "Hey, you're... Damn, I thought I had your name on the tip of my tongue. You look familiar, but... we've never met. I'm sure of it.$6",
    "Ivaras.AcceptBirthdayGift_Loved": "I was secretly hoping you’d remember what day it was. Thank you for the birthday gift, @, I love this!$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptBirthdayGift_Liked": "You remembered! You’ve just made my day. Thank you, @!$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptBirthdayGift_Disliked": "Ah... for my birthday, is it? You really didn’t have to...$6",
    "Ivaras.AcceptBirthdayGift_Hated": "Honestly, @, I thought you knew me better than that. To give me this, on my birthday, no less...$2",
    "Ivaras.AcceptBirthdayGift_Neutral": "Thank you for the birthday gift, @. Truly, I didn’t expect anything.",
    "Ivaras.AcceptBirthdayGift(O)395": "You know me well. I could always use a pick-me-up. Thank you for the birthday gift!$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptBirthdayGift(O)104": "Wow! This is beautiful. I didn't even know I wanted this. You really went above and beyond for me, huh? Thank you for the birthday gift, @!$1",
    "Ivaras.movieTheater": "It's crazy that a movie theater popped up in town so quickly. Back at home, my sister and I would go almost every other week to keep up with the new releases.",
    "Ivaras.MovieInvitation": "A movie? Yeah, that should be fun! Let me wrap up a few things first, and I’ll meet you there.",
    "Ivaras.MovieInvite_Spouse_IvarasWolfgang": "That sounds like fun! I’d love nothing more than to spend a night out with you. I’ll meet you there when you’re ready.$1",
    "Ivaras.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Oh, uh, that's awkward. {0} already invited me... Sorry!$6",
    "Ivaras.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "Again? So soon? Listen, how about we go next week instead, okay?$3",
    "Ivaras.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "...$3#$b#For real? Go away, please.$5",
    "Ivaras.RejectMovieTicket": "I don't know about that. Maybe next time... Sorry.$6",
    "Ivaras.Fair_Judging": "I really hope you win the display! I think it looks great.",
    "Ivaras.Fair_Judged_PlayerLost_PurpleShorts": "What was up with those shorts in your display..? I'm not sure if it really matched the theme.$6",
    "Ivaras.Fair_Judged_PlayerLost_Skipped": "Did you run out of time to gather stuff for your grange display? I would have helped you out, had I known.",
    "Ivaras.Fair_Judged_PlayerLost": "Hey, don't get too down about losing. There's always next year!",
    "Ivaras.Fair_Judged_PlayerWon": "As soon as I saw your display, I knew you were going to win! Good job!$1",
    "Ivaras.Fair_Judged": "Is the display judging over? Who won? I missed it.",
    "Ivaras.cc_Begin": "Have you seen any Junimos scampering around the old community center? I almost wanna keep one as a pet, but I don’t think [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] would approve.",
    "Ivaras.cc.Complete": "Wow, @, I’m very impressed with you. The Junimos told me about what you did for the community center. You gained a lot of favor in their beady little eyes.",
    "Ivaras.joja_Begin": "This is a grave moment for the poor Junimos that were living in the old community center... I can’t believe Joja took it over. This town deserves better than that.$2",
    "Ivaras.wonIceFishing": "I didn’t know you were such an adept fisher. I’d like you to teach me a thing or two one of these days.$1",
    "Ivaras.firstVisit_SkullCave": "There are many dangerous monsters within the Calico Desert’s Skull Cavern that must be contained within the lower levels.$6#$e#If they were to reach the surface... Well, I’d have my work cut out for me.$3#$b#I don’t want to use magic to harm anything. Better to use it as a preventative.$1",
    "Ivaras.firstVisit_Mine": "You’re being careful when you venture into the mines, yes?$3#$e#If you ever feel unsafe, I hope you’ll let me know. My work is important, sure, but more so is your safety.",
    "Ivaras.Mon": "I think I drank too much coffee today... I’ve got horrible acid reflux.$2#$e#Sorry, was that TMI?$8",
    "Ivaras.Mon2": "Hey @, I was just thinking about you. You moved to Pelican Town from where? Zuzu City, was it?
    #$q 401/402 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_movequestion_old#Which are you now, a country mouse, or a city mouse?
    #$r 401 0 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_movequestion_countrymouse#The country mouse. It's a lot safer out here than in the city.
    #$r 402 0 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_movequestion_citymouse#The city mouse. There were a lot of good restaruants in Zuzu that I miss.",
    "Ivaras.movequestion_countrymouse": "Ahh, I had a feeling you'd say that. It's quite charming, the valley. You fit right in here.",
    "Ivaras.movequestion_citymouse": "Really? Even now?$8#$b#Well, I hope this path leads you to wherever you want to be. I will support you however I can.",
    "Ivaras.movequestion_followup": "#$p 401 #I'll remember your answer.|I'll remember your answer.",
    "Ivaras.movequestion_old": "#$p 401 #Of course I remember, country mouse.$9|Of course I remember, city mouse.$9",
    "Ivaras.Mon4": "It's going to be a busy week, I can already tell... *sigh*$2",
    "Ivaras.Mon6": "You know, I’ve never been to Zuzu City. You’ll have to give me a tour someday. I’d be interested in seeing all your old hangout spots.",
    "Ivaras.Mon10": "You can call me Ives if you like. That’s how my family addresses me. I’d say we’re close enough for that kind of thing.",
    "Ivaras.Tue": "I arrived in Pelican Town shortly before you did. I’m from Grampleton.",
    "Ivaras.Tue2": "So... tired...$7#$b#@! I thought I was hallucinating for a moment.$8",
    "Ivaras.Tue4": "I’m craving an orange... I could eat a hundred of those things.$6",
    "Ivaras.Tue6": "I like to think I’m an open person, but I think it depends on who I’m talking to.#$e#I know that you’ll listen to most everything I say, and I thank you for that.$1",
    "Ivaras.Tue8": "I’m supposed to be wearing glasses, but I hate having to keep them clean.#$e#I can’t tell who’s coming at me until they’re fifteen feet in front of me.#$b#You, though, I can spot a mile away.$9",
    "Ivaras.Tue10": "Hello. I've got some work to do, but I'd love for you to hang around. Your presence always brightens my day.$4",
    "Ivaras.Wed": "My mentor is a stern [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderMan], but [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]’s been very patient with me.#$b#And [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim] tower is actually pretty cool, too.#$e#I’m just glad [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] doesn’t charge me rent!$1",
    "Ivaras.Wed2": "Hey, how are you doing? The farm treating you well?",
    "Ivaras.Wed4": "Do you grow rhubarb during the summer?#$e#My mom used to make a mean rhubarb pie. I wanna recreate it, but I’m not exactly a baker...Maybe I can use a transmutation circle?$6",
    "Ivaras.Wed6": "There’s a teleportation rune in the basement, but I am unable to activate it.$3#$e#There’s some sort of arcane lock on it... I’m too nervous to ask my mentor about it. Where could it lead?$6",
    "Ivaras.Wed8": "I still can’t believe you used to work for Joja Corp. I just can’t picture you sitting in a cubicle all day.#$e#Being out in the sun all day has given you a radiance unmatched by any other shiny... thing.",
    "Ivaras.Wed10": "I had a relationship in high school that I hid from those I was close with. I didn’t know how my parents... well, my dad would react.$6#$b#Thankfully, he never found out, but the relationship ended anyway. Bygones, and all.$3#$e#I’m older now, and a lot more mature. I would never let you slip from my adoring grasp.$9",
    "Ivaras.Thu": "That trio who play pool on Fridays, do you think they need a fourth player..? You know, for even teams, and all.$6",
    "Ivaras.Thu2": "I don’t often have the chance to go into town, but I’d like to when I have free time.$3#$e#Whenever that may be.$6",
    "Ivaras.Thu4": "Give me a recap on your week so far. You’re always out and about, and I don’t wanna miss any details. I live vicariously through you, you know.",
    "Ivaras.Thu6": "Do you visit the other villagers as often as you visit me?#$b#Uh... any special friends I don’t know about?$6",
    "Ivaras.Thu10": "Wanna know something crazy? I managed to dodge the draft thanks to my family’s connections to the Ministry of Magic.#$e#While it is not well known, wizards are under their own obligation to protect whatever region they’re sworn to.#$b#The Ferngill Republic government finds this to be an acceptable substitution for joining the army.",
    "Ivaras.Fri": "Are you going to the saloon tonight?#$e#Have fun, on my behalf.",
    "Ivaras.Fri2": "If you have any extra produce from your farm, feel free to bring it here. I’d much prefer to support your farm than something like Joja Mart slop.#$e#We’d pay you for whatever you brought.",
    "Ivaras.Fri4": "I used to have really short hair as a kid, then one day, I gained sentience and stopped letting my parents decide what haircut I had. I’ve been growing it out ever since.",
    "Ivaras.Fri6": "There are shrines out in the world that can do all sorts of things. Always be cognizant of what might happen when you use one.$3#$e#The butterfly effect is a very real thing.",
    "Ivaras.Fri8": "One of these days, I'd like to go to the saloon. When I have the time.#$b#...and confidence.$6",
    "Ivaras.Fri10": "My eyebrow slit might look cosmetic, but there’s actually a faint scar from when I smacked my brow on the corner of a table and split it open.$6#$e#I was a pretty dumb kid... I blacked right out after that and woke up to a teacher holding a bloodied cloth to my head.",
    "Ivaras.Sat": "I don’t know how long it will take until I learn everything [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] knows. By the time I graduate from being an apprentice, I’ll have to look for one myself. It’s an endless cycle, isn’t it?",
    "Ivaras.Sat2": "Got any fun plans for the weekend?#$e#Me? Well, I'll be here. It's not often you'll find me elsewhere.",
    "Ivaras.Sat4": "[LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] is funny. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim]] version of kicking it back for the weekend is allowing [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHimself] a glass of red wine after 5 PM.",
    "Ivaras.Sat6": "A purple-haired girl sometimes hangs out beside the cliff face just south of the tower.$6#$b#I don’t have the bravery to talk to her, only spare a few awkward glances as we cross paths.$6#$e$Why does she keep coming out this way?$6",
    "Ivaras.Sat8": "My sister goes to art school, believe it or not. Why did she get all the artistic genes, and I got nothing? The world is cruel and unfair.",
    "Ivaras.Sat10": "Hey, @.#$b#Are you free right now? I've got a moment to take a break, if you'd be willing to stick around for a while.$4",
    "Ivaras.Sun": "It’s the start of a new week.$3#$b#I can’t help but dread the work ahead of me.$6",
    "Ivaras.Sun2": "How are you liking this new life of yours, @? I’d say it suits you rather well.",
    "Ivaras.Sun4": "Do you believe in Yoba? Today is a day of worship, I hear.#$e#I don’t partake myself, but I will never speak ill of anyone who does.",
    "Ivaras.Sun6": "Do you have any cats on your farm?#$e#An old neighbor of mine had barn cats, and I made friends with most of them. I spent a lot of my allowance on cat food back then.",
    "Ivaras.Sun8": "You’ve got a smudge of dirt on your cheek... Ah, got it. Nothing a bit of saliva on the thumb can’t fix.",
    "Ivaras.Sun10": "It’s really hard to make me genuinely angry. There have only been a small handful of times when I’ve felt the scorch of seething rage.#$e#You’ll never see that side of me, I can promise that. I could never feel a shred of hatred for you.",
    "Ivaras.spring_12": "Will you be hunting for eggs tomorrow? Good luck, if you are.",
    "Ivaras.spring_14_2": "The Desert Festival starts tomorrow. It lasts for a few days, so you should try to go when you can. While you’re at it, bring me back a cool souvenir!",
    "Ivaras.spring_23": "Ah, the Flower Dance... I've heard horror stories about the jumpsuits the guys have to wear.#$b#You'd never catch me in one of those.$1",
    "Ivaras.summer_1": "This is a busy season for us wizards. Magic is very potent in the summer.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Mon": "Lots to do today, @! I’ll catch up with you later.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Mon2": "I suppose you may be wondering what we do in the tower all day.#$b#The answer to that is a hell of a lot of reading, and the occasional day trip to strengthen the various wards in the valley.#$e#But, mostly reading.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Mon4": "You look like you’ve been working pretty hard. Care for a coffee?[395]",
    "Ivaras.summer_Mon8": "You seem like you have good music taste, got any recommendations for me?#$b#I’ve been listening to the same playlists over and over again, and it’s starting to drive me a little insane.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Mon10": "Did you run here..? You look kinda cute when you’re disheveled.#$b#Er... I mean, you look very put together. Not disheveled at all.$8",
    "Ivaras.summer_Tue": "Man, this heat... It makes me wanna cut off all my hair.#$e#Don’t worry, I’d never actually do it.$1",
    "Ivaras.summer_Tue2": "I had to scrub the inside of the cauldron the other day. Draining it was one thing, but getting past the thick layer of grime was even more strenuous.$6#$e#Needless to say, my arms are very sore right now.$7",
    "Ivaras.summer_Tue4": "It's the season of dehydration. I’ve been drinking so much water, but I’ve never seen [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] take a single sip. How is [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] still alive?$6",
    "Ivaras.summer_Tue6": "That Shrine of Illusion in the basement is quite the powerful altar. I could change into a woman if I so pleased.#$b#Wouldn’t that be quite the prank?$1#$e#Next time you visit, who knows what you’ll find.$9",
    "Ivaras.summer_Tue8": "Oh... You’ve got a bit of a sunburn on your cheeks. Do you want me to make you an aloe salve?",
    "Ivaras.summer_Tue10": "We should take a trip to the city and see if we can find some record shops. I’m sure Zuzu has a lot more diverse vinyls than Grampleton.#$e#Our store at home rarely cycled its stock...$6#$e#Would a date like that interest you?",
    "Ivaras.summer_Wed": "I need to buy more clothes suited for hot weather. These long sleeves are not it.$2",
    "Ivaras.summer_Wed4": "I got my lip pierced at the ripe age of sixteen. My dad was absolutely appalled when he first noticed.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Wed6": "I’m glad you moved to Pelican Town. I think you’re the only villager I’ve talked to more than once. Other than my mentor, of course.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Wed8": "I want to know everything about you. I hope that’s not too forward, it’s just...You pique my interest.$4",
    "Ivaras.summer_Wed10": "Can I be honest with you..? I’m not the strongest swimmer.#$b#If you ever wanna take a dip in the river, well... I’d be fine so long as I don’t go more than waist-deep.#$e#If the current took me, you’d never see me again!$8",
    "Ivaras.summer_Thu": "I have to sleep with a fan on every night. There is no air conditioning in the tower whatsoever...$2",
    "Ivaras.summer_Thu2": "I like to imagine that when I’m old, I’ll have a long grey beard, and wear a blue, starry cloak and hat. That’d be pretty badass.#$e#Ooh...Maybe I’ll even procure an orb of my own, like the one Welwick has.#$e#Only then can I call myself a true wizard.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Thu4": "There would be hope for humanity if only we could see with eyes unclouded by hate. Imagine the possibilities... Yet the energies remain passive for now.$6",
    "Ivaras.summer_Thu6": "Do you cook? I’d like to learn, but I’m not very intuitive when it comes to that kind of stuff. Maybe you could show me a thing or two.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Thu8": "Don’t work too hard out in the fields. Heat exhaustion is no joke, and I’d hate to see you ill.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Thu10": "It wasn’t until high school that my father began harassing me to study magic. I learned a few things growing up, of course, but it was only then that he became iron-fisted.$3#$e#I’ll admit I was sassy and tried to rebel, but I’ve learned it’s just easier to go along with it. It’s a lot less stress for everyone.$6",
    "Ivaras.summer_Fri": "I could use a break. Perhaps a beer, if time would allow.$3#$e#Do enjoy yourself today.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Fri2": "Hey, good to see you. I was hoping you’d come see me today. It’s like you read my mind.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Fri4": "Wars are being fought that no one even knows about. In fact, one just recently ended. Things are still tense between the Dwarves and the Shadow People, however.$6#$e#It’s hard to make peace after a millennium of fighting. I understand that more than most.$3",
    "Ivaras.summer_Fri6": "Do you speak to [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] often? [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]] bears a lot of knowledge, and I’m sure [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] has some useful bits of advice for you.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Fri8": "Why hello there, @. Any fun plans for your Friday night? It makes me very happy that you came all this way to see me.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Fri10": "You feeling hot in this weather? Honestly, the fewer clothes, the better. Just a thought.$4",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sat": "I hope my younger sister is doing okay. I haven’t seen her in a while.$6",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sat2": "I wonder if the town’s library has any interesting books. Preferably something non-magical.$6",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sat4": "Junimos are a sign of a healthy forest. They live with the trees; always check the canopy before chopping one down. You could be evicting a family from their home.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sat6": "Don’t forget to wear sun protection when you’re in the fields. The radiation from the sun could damage your cells, and unfortunately, not even magic can cure that.#$e#Please take care of yourself.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sat8": "My sister, Selene, should be on break from school now. We used to explore the woods behind our house around this time of year when we were younger.#$e#I was always on the lookout for wolves or bears. I didn’t want her to get scared.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sat10": "If you ever want to sneak away for a little while, just give me the word.#$b#I’d be willing to get into all sorts of trouble with you.$4",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sun": "Dusk is my favorite time of day. It’s when life in the valley quiets down, and I feel like I can finally take a breath.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sun2": "The days are the longest during this time of year. Too bad it’s so fleeting.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sun4": "Don’t be intimidated by [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName]. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]] may be a grumbling old [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderMan], but I know [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] was lonely before I came along. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]] could use a friend like you, too.",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sun6": "I can’t believe you walked all this way in the heat. Don’t worry, I have something cold for you, hold on...#$b#Alright, press the glass to your face. It’ll help cool you down.[903]",
    "Ivaras.summer_Sun10": "You always seem to appear when I’m feeling lonely. I think you’re single-handedly curing me, @.$4",
    "Ivaras.summer_10": "Will you be attending the Luau tomorrow?#$b#Apparently, merpeople will be there, hidden from the villagers' sight.$6#$e#...I probably wasn't supposed to tell you that.$3",
    "Ivaras.summer_20": "I went to take a walk today and saw all sorts of people outside. It's safe to say I didn't end up leaving the tower.",
    "Ivaras.summer_20_2": "I forgot to buy a pole, dammit!$5#$b#No Trout Derby for me this year.$2",
    "Ivaras.summer_21": "You know, the Trout Derby is kind of growing on me. Maybe next year I'll buy a fishing pole and get out there.",
    "Ivaras.summer_21_2": "I'm probably missing out on all sorts of prizes out there...$2",
    "Ivaras.summer_24": "I can’t wait for fall, when things finally cool down. The trees turn pretty colors, too, so that’s a plus.",
    "Ivaras.summer_27": "The Lunaloos will be migrating in tomorrow! How exciting.",
    "Ivaras.fall_1": "Fall’s finally here. I’ve been waiting for this all year long.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Mon": "It’s cold enough now that I can put away my fan at night. I hope this doesn’t mean the tower will freeze in the winter...",
    "Ivaras.fall_Mon2": "I like being surrounded by greenery when I need to focus. That's why my desk is surrounded by a jungle. The oxygen they produce goes right to my brain.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Mon4": "I’ve heard legends of a malicious shrine known for turning children into doves. Imagine the horror...$6#$e#Would those poor children know anything of their past life? Or would they fly eternally, led by a faint sense of a long-lost home?$6#$e#I can only hope the rumors aren’t true. That would be highly unethical.$3",
    "Ivaras.fall_Mon6": "If you grow any pumpkins this year, you should bring a few over. It might be fun to carve them together.$4",
    "Ivaras.fall_Mon10": "I’ve been trying my hand at cooking lately. Wanna try some of this? I was planning on sipping it out of my thermos, but I’d rather you take it with you.[236]",
    "Ivaras.fall_Tue": "People hate on pumpkin spice, but let me tell you a secret.#$b#It’s actually not bad.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Tue2": "The raccoons around these parts are more sentient than the ones I’ve encountered at home. Have you noticed how they just... stare?$3#$e#They don’t seem to be frightened by humans. I’m tempted to give them a snack or something, but I don’t want to disturb the natural order of things.$6",
    "Ivaras.fall_Tue4": "I saw a bear at the edge of the woods the other day. I’ll have to keep an ear out when I’m meditating.$6#$e#Please be careful if you’re wandering the area near dusk...$3",
    "Ivaras.fall_Tue6": "Are you familiar with the Hat Mouse south of the tower? There are a few items at that shop I think would look adequate on you.#$b#Like this one.[(H)60]#$e#What? No, I definitely didn’t steal that from [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName]’s spare trunk of clothing.$9#$e#But... Don’t wear that when [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]’s around. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]] might think it looks better on you and get self-conscious.$1",
    "Ivaras.fall_Tue8": "I’ve begun simmering cloves, vanilla, and citrus in the hearth, and now the tower is rid of that acrid cauldron smell.#$b#I hope it makes your mouth water, cuz mine sure does.$9",
    "Ivaras.fall_Tue10": "Do you ever find yourself wishing you had another pair of hands to help out at the farm?#$e#Maybe I can conjure a golem to help with your farm chores. Give me some time to brainstorm.$6",
    "Ivaras.fall_Wed": "I’m grateful that [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] has a fireplace. I never knew I liked getting gently toasted until I sat in front of it the other day.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Wed2": "Hey, how's it going?
    #$q 501/502 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_mayoquestion_old#I've got a question for you. Do you put mayo on your sandwiches?
    #$r 501 20 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_mayoquestion_yes#I slather it on, yeah.
    #$r 502 -20 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_mayoquestion_no#No, I'm not a fan.",
    "Ivaras.mayoquestion_yes": "...We're still friends, but I have to say, I disapprove.$6",
    "Ivaras.mayoquestion_no": "You don't? I'm glad we can agree on something #1",
    "Ivaras.mayoquestion_old": "I was just thinking about what to eat for dinner... Preferably, a recipe that doesn't use mayo.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Wed4": "Word of the wise, if you grow fairy roses, you might be blessed in the night by a small, sparkling visitor.#$b#It could mean a few extra gold coins in your pocket at the end of the day.#$b#Here. I wanted to surprise you with them. I hope the legends are true.#$action AddItem 425 5",
    "Ivaras.fall_Wed8": "My sweet mother calls quite often. She’s asked about you a time or two.#$b#Why..? Er... I mention your visits here and there.$6",
    "Ivaras.fall_Wed10": "My mom really wants to meet you. She’s been talking about visiting with Selene soon.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Thu": "I’d like to go on a walk later. Hopefully, before the sun goes down.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Thu2": "If you’re ever curious about magic, I would love to show you a few things.#$e#It’s mostly an excuse to regurgitate ancient texts, but I can always skip to the fun parts.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Thu4": "I heard a wicked laugh echo from the sky the other day. It was nightfall, and I couldn’t see what it was.$6#$e#Isn’t that freaky? I’m never leaving the tower after dark again...$8",
    "Ivaras.fall_Thu6": "It is not as easy as drawing a sigil with a regular pen and paper to summon magic.#$b#One must acquire magical ink that flows through a sharp-pointed wand, and only then can the energies be conjured.#$e#Do I sound like my mentor?",
    "Ivaras.fall_Thu8": "Nights are getting longer. If you ever want me to walk you home from the tower, I’d be more than happy.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Thu10": "Hey... I want you to know you’ve given me a lot of inspiration to keep going.#$b#Sometimes I remember that if I had never been sent here, I wouldn’t have gotten to meet you. And then I realize how grateful I am to be in your corner of the world.$1#$e#Hehe...sorry for being sappy.$4",
    "Ivaras.fall_Fri": "Classes would have been starting right about now, had I gone to college. Sometimes I wonder what my life would have been like if I weren’t a wizard.$3#$b#What would I have studied?$6",
    "Ivaras.fall_Fri4": "It’s so easy to pluck a blackberry bush clean of its fruit. I have to remind myself that other creatures feed on them, too.#$e#Can’t be too greedy now!$9",
    "Ivaras.fall_Fri6": "Do you think we could convince [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] to dress up for Spirit’s Eve?#$e#Maybe if we both use our best puppy-dog eyes, [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]’ll cave...$1",
    "Ivaras.fall_Fri8": "I want to amaze you, @. It’s what motivates me to keep going on bad days.#$e#The look on your face when I show you a flashy little cantrip is like fuel to me.$4",
    "Ivaras.fall_Fri10": "Mmm... You smell good. What scent are you wearing?#$e#I’ll miss it when it fades.$1",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sat": "Wouldn’t it be fitting to have a cat running around the tower?",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sat2": "I wore the same costume for five years in a row for Spirit's Eve as a kid.
    #$q 601/602 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_spiritsevequestion_old#Can you guess what it was?
    #$r 601 10 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_spiritsevequestion_wolf#A wolf.
    #$r 602 0 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_spiritsevequestion_magician#A magician.
    #$r 602 0 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_spiritsevequestion_gunslinger#A gunslinger.",
    "Ivaras.spiritsevequestion_wolf": "How'd you know!?$8#$b#I guess that was an easy answer, given my last name is Wolfgang...",
    "Ivaras.spiritsevequestion_magician": "Not quite, but I think I could pull it off.",
    "Ivaras.spiritsevequestion_gunslinger": "Dang, like the Prairie King? That’d be cool, but I didn’t even know what that game was yet.",
    "Ivaras.spiritsevequestion_old": "Did you dress up for Spirit's Eve back in the day?",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sat4": "Do you have any pomegranate trees? They’re one of my favorite fruits.#$e#If you're feeling generous enough to bring some over, I’d deseed some for both of us. I know it’s a hassle, but I’d take on the burden of the mess.$9#$e#It’s only fair.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sat6": "Fall really brings out the more mellow side of my music taste. It must be that I want to subconsciously ease into the low-energy ambience of winter.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sat8": "My parents took it easy on my sister growing up. I love Selene a lot, don’t get me wrong, but we didn’t always have a harmonious relationship.$3#$e#There was a time when we couldn’t even be in the same room without having a go at one another.$6",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sat10": "I’ve seen many curiosities, yet there are infinitely more waiting to be unveiled.$6#$b#You are among them, as deep and mysterious as the Gem Sea.$3#$e#And I’ve only discovered about two percent of what lies within.$9",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sun": "How has your week been? Tell me all about it.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sun2": "Fog tends to linger over the forest lake in the mornings. It’s honestly really peaceful.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sun4": "Sometimes, when I’ve hit a wall with my studies, I like to read comics to reset my mind. It feels a bit childish, but it works.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sun6": "I’ve been putting cinnamon in my coffee grounds lately. You should try it at home.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sun8": "We should picnic while the tree leaves are still colorful. It’s always good to enjoy a quiet moment, especially with someone you’re close with.",
    "Ivaras.fall_Sun10": "I wasn’t so sure I believed in Yoba before you came along.#$b#I still don’t, to be honest, but some string of fate kept me tethered to you since our first meeting. Perhaps there is a higher power smiling down on me.",
    "Ivaras.fall_15": "My mentor and I will be heading to the fair tomorrow.#$b#Honestly, I was surprised when [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] brought it up. That [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderMan] rarely leaves [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim] cauldron's side.",
    "Ivaras.fall_26": "[LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] and I are going to help put some things together for Spirit's Eve tomorrow.#$e#You'd better come and see!$1",
    "Ivaras.winter_1": "You can’t believe how relieved I am. With the change of seasons, I can finally take it easy for a while.$1#$b#I mean, yeah, there’s still studying to be done, but... Not as much.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Mon": "Like any other kid, I got my tongue stuck to a pole once.#$b#My sister has a picture of it somewhere.$9",
    "Ivaras.winter_Mon2": "If you ever need to borrow any books, feel free to browse the shelves in my room. I’ve read mostly everything in there already, so don’t worry about returning them anytime soon.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Mon4": "How are you faring, @? Staying warm?",
    "Ivaras.winter_Mon6": "The Deep Woods behind our tower is soaked in elemental essence as thick as honey.#$b#The slimes there continue to populate even though we exterminate them repeatedly. Be careful if you venture out that way.$3#$e#It would make me ill to see you succumb to their corrosive digestive fluid...$2",
    "Ivaras.winter_Mon8": "It’s not been easy to appease my father. To this day, I’m not certain he’ll ever think I’m a sufficient enough wizard.$6#$e#He was always the best of the best, and I can’t say I’m following suit, but... I’m trying.$3#$e#That’s what matters, right?$3",
    "Ivaras.winter_Mon10": "If you’re cold, I can keep you company by the fire. Stay as long as you’d like.$4",
    "Ivaras.winter_Tue": "The holidays are approaching pretty quickly now.
    #$q 301/302 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_giftquestion_old#Do you like getting gifts during this season?
    #$r 301 20 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_giftquestion_yes#I love getting gifts!
    #$r 302 0 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_giftquestion_meh#I'm indifferent about it.
    #$r 302 -10 starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve_giftquestion_no#I'm not interested in any sort of gift.",
    "Ivaras.giftquestion_yes": "Alright, good to know.",
    "Ivaras.giftquestion_meh": "Really? That's interesting...$6",
    "Ivaras.giftquestion_no": "Alright, good to know.",
    "Ivaras.giftquestion_old": "Hmm... I need to start writing down what people like.$6#$b#Why..? Well, I never know what to buy for gifts. That's all.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Tue2": "I saw two foxes prancing in the snow the other day. Their fur gets so bushy during winter... It’s really cute.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Tue4": "Mayonnaise is absolutely revolting, yet there are some out there who would bathe in it.$6#$e#Goblins, for example, can’t get enough of the stuff. Yuck.$2",
    "Ivaras.winter_Tue6": "The tower creaks a lot at night. It’s probably just settling, the old thing.#$e#I know your farmhouse is pretty ancient, does it do the same thing?",
    "Ivaras.winter_Tue8": "Would you ever be interested in visiting Grampleton?",
    "Ivaras.winter_Tue10": "My home in Grampleton had a more modern heating system, but I admit, I’ve become charmed to the concept of a rustic fireplace.#$e#Do you have one? I could sneak over to the farmhouse one night and lie by yours with you. It’d be nice to be alone, just you and I.$9",
    "Ivaras.winter_Wed": "It’s kind of peaceful looking out at the snow when dawn comes. When the sun hits just right, everything shimmers.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Wed2": "Have you been ice-skating before? If it gets really cold, the pond might freeze over, then you could try your hand at it.#$e#I’m pretty agile on skates, believe it or not.$1",
    "Ivaras.winter_Wed4": "Wouldn’t it be nice to visit the Fern Islands right about now?$6#$b#No matter how many pairs of socks I wear, my feet still won’t shake that icy feeling...$7",
    "Ivaras.winter_Wed6": "I really wish I could draw, or paint, or something. I have all these ideas for graphic novels, but I don’t have the skill to back them up.#$e#Alas, these hands are cursed with chicken scratch lines.$2",
    "Ivaras.winter_Wed8": "Do you think a Winter Star tree would fit in the tower? It could be nice to put one up.#$b#I never used to be festive, but for some reason, I feel more inspired these days.$9#$e#We could decorate it together and surprise [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName].",
    "Ivaras.winter_Wed10": "@! Your nose is so red.$8#$b#I’ll lend you a scarf of mine. No, I insist, seriously.$4",
    "Ivaras.winter_Thu": "Winter makes me feel so unmotivated. How do you keep up with everything on that farm of yours?",
    "Ivaras.winter_Thu2": "Holly is deceiving. The berries look delectable, but even ingesting a few can upset your stomach a lot.$3#$e#Don’t tell anybody this, but I went to the hospital when I was in middle school for eating a handful on account of a dare.$6#$e#I still remember the burn of bile in the back of my throat... Sorry if you find that gross.$3",
    "Ivaras.winter_Thu4": "I suppose there are some crops that persevere through winter. I hadn’t even heard of a powdermelon until recently.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Thu6": "Wanna know a secret?$9#$b#I’ve always wanted to try a cigarette. Something about it screams cool, don’t you think?",
    "Ivaras.winter_Thu8": "The new year is coming up soon, do you have any resolutions?#$b#One of mine is to drink less coffee. We’ll see how long that lasts.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Thu10": "One day, if the stars align once more, I want to show you a rare cosmic phenomenon.#$b#Have you heard of a Prismatic Moon? It is not visible to the naked eye, but I have the means to share my enchanted sight with you.#$b#It’s probably my favorite thing in the world. I’d love nothing more than for you to see it too.$4",
    "Ivaras.winter_Fri": "Should I grow a beard? It might help keep me warm.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Fri4": "Winter must be a change of pace for you, no? Without crops to worry about, you must have a lot more free time.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Fri6": "Honestly, @? I’m apprehensive about what the future holds for me.$3#$b#I love to learn and grow, but is there anything else out there for me?$6",
    "Ivaras.winter_Fri8": "I was craving spicy food today, so I whipped up a little something. My eyes were bigger than my stomach, though. Care to try some?[226]",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sat": "You’ve got snowflakes on your eyelashes.#$b#Ahh... They’re dewdrops now.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sat2": "Hi, @! How was your week? Busy as usual, I assume?",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sat4": "I’m really missing television right about now. A good show makes the time pass super quickly during such a dreary season.$6",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sat6": "Um... I hope I’m not out of line for asking, but will your finances be okay without having crops to sell during this season?$3#$b#If you ever need any help, please ask. I will do what I can to help you in any way possible.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sat8": "I can’t believe [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] was once betrothed. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]] doesn't really talk about it, but man, am I tempted to pry.$1",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sat10": "@! Come closer, I’ve discovered something unbelievable...$8#$b#Did you know that [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] might have a secret child somewhere in the valley? Keep your eyes peeled... It could be anyone.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sun": "Days like these make me want to curl up in bed for as long as possible.$7",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sun2": "I’ve run out of comics to read in my stash... I wish we had a store nearby that I could browse.$2#$b#Guess I’ll have to put it on a back burner for now.$3",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sun4": "Childhood was a much simpler time. I think back to when my friends and I would roam the streets in search of a park with a decent swing set to harass.$6#$b#Do you know of any parks around here? We should contemplate our existences and swing together sometime.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sun6": "On a clear night, the sky sometimes lights up with dancing colors, called aurora polaris.#$b#There’s a hefty telescope at the top of the tower, so if you have a free evening, you should come and see. It’s hypnotizing.",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sun8": "Your hands look cold. Would you like coffee? Hot cocoa, maybe?",
    "Ivaras.winter_Sun10": "I heard you sniffle, you’re not getting sick, are you?$8#$b#I hope you’ll let me know if you need bedside care. It makes me worried knowing you’d be all alone in that farmhouse of yours.$3",
    "Ivaras.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121001": "I’m glad you weren’t caught in the crossfire of my malfunctioning potion. Next time you visit, surely I’ll have nailed the right recipe.#$b#That is, if I didn’t scare you off for good.$9",
    "Ivaras.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121002": "You almost got me in trouble the other day in the forest. It's hard not to say hello to you.",
    "Ivaras.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121003": "I had a lot of fun with you the other day. Feel free to whisk me away again any time!$1#$b#On another note, [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] is warming up to you, I think. Why else would [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] have let me go early..?",
    "Ivaras.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121004": "Hey, about that evening in the rain... I just wanted to let you know how grateful I am to have someone like you in my life.$3#$b#I've been thinking nonstop about the look on your face as you listened to me.$6#$b#I've never felt more heard in my life. Thank you, @.",
    "Ivaras.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121005": "I wish I could live out that night at the Saloon again. I don't think I've ever had that much fun.$1#$b#My favorite part, though, was the end.$4#$b#I hope it's the same for you, too.$4",
    "Ivaras.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121006": "Well... You've finally met the High and Mighty Percival. I'm really sorry you had to listen to him talk like that.$6#$b#I'm just happy Selene will be moving here soon. That means we will have a potential babysitter, you know...$9",
    "Ivaras.married_wizard": "I'm very happy the old [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderMan] found love again. Ever since you started coming around, [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] has spoken of you nonstop. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim]] last marriage didn't go over all that well, but I'm sure second time's the charm.#$b#...The tower will be lonely without [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim]. And I'm sure I'll be seeing less of you, too, now that you're living your lives out together.$2#$b#Sigh. Oh, well. Just don't forget about me, okay? I'll hold down the fort for now.",

    //Ivaras Summit Dialogue
    "Ivaras.SummitEvent_Dialogue3_IvarasWolfgang": "I never thought a love like ours was ever going to be in the cards for me.$6#$b#I've spent my life chasing something I never thought I could reach, but now that I have you, I believe that anything is possible.$3#$b#There's something about you that sets you apart from anyone else. A magic, unique to you, that I want to be enveloped in every day, for the rest of my life.$4#$b#I love you, @. And I am so proud of everything you have accomplished.$4",

    //Ivaras Engaged Dialogue
    "Proposal.IvarasWolfgang_Engaged": "!!!... @, of course I’ll marry you!$8#$b#I can’t believe you beat me to it... To make up for my lateness, I’ll get everything set up. Give me three days.$4",
    "Engaged.IvarasWolfgang0": "Life has felt unreal today. When I first met you, I never thought we'd end up here. I wouldn't change a single thing.$4",
    "Engaged.IvarasWolfgang1": "I'm so nervous for tomorrow, I've got all sorts of butterflies in my stomach...$2#$b#How are you staying so cool-headed?",

    //Ivaras Marriage Dialogue
    "Marriage.IvarasWolfgang_AfterWedding": "I'm honestly still in shock. I love this. I love you. I will never, ever leave your side.$4",
    "Marriage.patio_IvarasWolfgang": "%You should leave him alone for now. He'll be happy to see you when he's not trying to focus.",
    "Marriage.spouseRoom_IvarasWolfgang": "Oh, hi, honey. I'm trying to remember what chapter of this manga I left off on. I need to get a bookmark...",
    "Marriage.funLeave_IvarasWolfgang": "I have to go to the tower today. If you need me, you'll find me there.#$e#Make safe choices today. *smooch*$9",
    "Marriage.funReturn_IvarasWolfgang": "Aren't you a sight for sore eyes!$4#$b#No, literally, my eyes are sore from reading so many tomes. Come kiss the pain away, pleeease!$1",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Night_0": "Aw, honey... You're drenched! Come here.$8",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Night_1": "I've set out dry clothes for you on the bed. It's your favorite shirt of mine, pre-worn and everything.$4",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Night_2": "I'm in a great mood. I made some breakthroughs with the elementals today. I'll be reporting to [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] first thing tomorrow.",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Night_3": "I almost fell asleep at my desk today, with the rain ambience and all. I had to walk a few laps around the house to wake up a bit.$6",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Night_4": "Me and %pet were just hanging out all day. Honestly, I love having a pet. It makes the house feel more homey.",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Night_5": "We're gonna be quite the duo when we're old.#$b#Me, the big-shot wizard protecting the valley, and you, the big-shot farmer who feeds the entire population. What would they do without us?$1",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Night_IvarasWolfgang": "How was your day today? I missed you...$4#$b$I wanted to surprise you with a meal. I'm not the best at cooking, but I hope you like it.$4[226 204 236 230 244 265]",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Day_0": "Jeez, it's really coming down out there. Are you sure you wanna go outside?",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Day_1": "I love the rain so long as I can watch it from inside.#$e#My hair gets crazy frizzy when it dries.$6",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Day_2": "Come home quickly today. I don't want you to freeze to death in the rain. Otherwise, it'll be the start of my villain origin story.",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Day_3": "Isn't it a good day to cuddle under a blanket? Once your chores are done, I'll be waiting here for you.#$b#Rather eagerly, too.$4",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Day_4": "I've got some work to do today. Storms open up certain magical channels, and I must tune in for a short while.$6",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Day_5": "I'll do some chores in between studies today. You deserve to come back to a clean home. It's the least I can do after all your physical labor throughout the day.",
    "Marriage.Rainy_Day_IvarasWolfgang": "Watch your step when you're outside. Frogs blend into the ground pretty well, and I'd hate for a little critter to be crushed.",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Night_0": "You smell like the outdoors. Come here, let me get a closer whiff. *grab*$4",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Night_1": "I've been looking forward to relaxing with you all day. You'd best be home for the night.",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Night_2": "I didn't have time to prepare something for dinner, how do you feel about getting takeout from the Saloon?$6#$b#Gus makes a pretty mean pizza, I've learned.",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Night_3": "It's been hard to find a work-life balance, but I think I'm managing alright so far. I want you to promise me you'd tell me if things weren't to your liking.",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Night_4": "I'm pretty tired after today. I've been taking in caffeine like crazy, but I'm sure I'll fall asleep just fine tonight.$7#$b#Enough about me, though. How was your day, honey?",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Night_IvarasWolfgang": "My sister called today. It was nice catching up with her. Even Dad said hello on the phone, can you believe it?",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Day_0": "I made coffee for both of us. I have a hard time starting my day without it.[395]",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Day_1": "Who'd have thought that a farmer and a wizard would make such a good pair?$1",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Day_2": "Did you dream last night? You were making some noise.#$b#Must have been a good one.$4",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Day_3": "Did you sleep well last night? It wasn't too cold for you in the room, was it?$3#$e#Sorry. I have trouble falling asleep when it's hot.$6",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Day_4": "If you need help on the farm today, let me know. I have some things to do, but I will always make time for you.",
    "Marriage.Indoor_Day_IvarasWolfgang": "You look lovely right now. You know what? Maybe stay with me today... I don't want anyone to steal you away looking like that.",
    "Marriage.Outdoor_0": "I need to check for weak spots in the warding barrier around the farm. Can't risk any monsters getting in.",
    "Marriage.Outdoor_1": "You work so hard all day... My heart always feels lighter when you come to me for a refresh.$4",
    "Marriage.Outdoor_2": "There is a certain energy radiating from your Grandpa's shrine. He may very well be keeping an eye on you from the spirit world.",
    "Marriage.Outdoor_3": "Should we swap roles for a day? It could be fun. Although I don't think I could swing a hoe as precisely as you do.",
    "Marriage.Outdoor_4": "Hi, love. What are your plans for the rest of the day?#$e#Just don't forget about your poor husband alone at home all day.$1",
    "Marriage.Outdoor_IvarasWolfgang": "It's good to get fresh air sometimes. I tended to coop myself up in the tower too often, when I still lived there.$6",
    "Marriage.OneKid_0": "Man, that kid wakes up early. Gotta have coffee in that pot at all times.$7#$e#I wouldn't trade it for anything in the world, though. I'm used to late nights and early mornings.",
    "Marriage.OneKid_1": "I still can't believe we're parents now. How did that happen?$6#$b#...Just kidding. I know how.$4",
    "Marriage.OneKid_2": "%kid1 made quite the mess today. Luckily, I thought of a quick solution and got it all cleaned up before you saw anything.#$e#It's times like these where I'm glad I spent my life learning magic.",
    "Marriage.OneKid_3": "*murmur* La-da-doo, la-la-loo... dah-duh-doo...#$b#...$3#$b#...Yes, that's one of the nursery chimes. What can I say? It's stuck in my head.",
    "Marriage.OneKid_4": "I've been riding the high of being a father since %kid1 came into our lives, but... I think it's starting to feel normal now.#$b#Wanna spice it up and add a second to the mix?$4#$e#Come on, even numbers are better than odd, they say.",
    "Marriage.TwoKids_0": "The great thing about having two arms is I can hold both of our kids at once.#$e#Aw, I just realized... How am I suposed to hold all three of you at the same time..?$2",
    "Marriage.TwoKids_1": "It's so interesting, seeing the differences in %kid1's and %kid2's personalities. They're young, but you can still tell how vastly different they are.",
    "Marriage.TwoKids_2": "I feel very grateful about our life together. I couldn't have asked for a better family than this.$1",
    "Marriage.TwoKids_3": "I've been wondering if this is how my parents felt when Selene and I were young.$6#$b#I just really hope I have a closer relationship with our kids than I had with my dad. I would be heartbroken if they didn't like me...$2",
    "Marriage.TwoKids_4": "Don't worry about the kids today, honey. I'll make sure they're fed and bathed. I want you to be able to relax.#$e#You work so hard, after all.$9",
    "Marriage.Good_0": "You know... for someone who knows a lot about magic, there's one thing I still can't comprehend.$6#$b#The spell you put me under that made me fall so hard for you. Truly, I don't know what you've done to me.$4",
    "Marriage.Good_1": "Wow, you look cute today. Did you do something with your hair?$4#$b#Well, I love it. It suits you.$9",
    "Marriage.Good_2": "Sometimes, when my eyes start to blur from staring at books too long, I like to reset by watching you when you're not looking.#$e#You do this cute thing where you bite the inside of your lip when you're really focused on something.$1",
    "Marriage.Good_3": "*yawn* Honey...$7#$b#I know you've got work to do, but let's lay together for a little while. You look so warm... and I'm feeling rather chilly right now.$4",
    "Marriage.Good_4": "Remember, if you're ever in danger, squeeze the charm I gave you and I'll come straight away.#$b#You still carry that with you, right?$6",
    "Marriage.Good_5": "You are just so hypnotic... I could watch you all day.#$b#Especially if I'm supposed to be working.$9",
    "Marriage.Good_6": "What are you thinking right now?#$e#I'm just curious what goes on inside that head of yours.",
    "Marriage.Good_7": "You're probably the only person who has seen every part of me, and I love you for that. On my worst and best days, I know you'll be there for me.#$e#And I, for you.$9",
    "Marriage.Good_8": "A new comic series came out a few days ago. I just started it, but man, I think it's gonna be a favorite for me.$1",
    "Marriage.Good_9": "Have you had time for your hobbies lately, honey? You've been working so hard, I don't want you to lose yourself in your job.#$e#It's healthy to take a break every now and then.",
    "Marriage.Neutral_0": "I wonder if I'll be able to visit Grampleton again. I'm sure [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] would be fine with it... I'll have to ask.$6",
    "Marriage.Neutral_1": "Man, I've been restless today. I wanna do something! But I don't know what.",
    "Marriage.Neutral_2": "Should I get another piercing? I was thinking of a septum ring, or something",
    "Marriage.Neutral_3": "It's easy to fall behind on chores, living in a big house. Maybe we should downsize?",
    "Marriage.Neutral_4": "I wish I could have met your Grandpa before he passed. I'm sure he's proud that you're carrying on his legacy.",
    "Marriage.Neutral_5": "I had a very strange dream with you in it last night. You were hanging out with Sebastian, and I... I dunno.$6#$b#It was weird. I swear I'm not the jealous type...$3",
    "Marriage.Neutral_6": "Do we need anything from the General Store?#$b#I kind of like shopping there. It's a closer walk from the farm than it was from the tower.$6#$e#Not that I really got groceries while living there...$6",
    "Marriage.Neutral_7": "Make sure you're keeping in touch with your friends in town. It's easy to lose track of time and not speak for a while.",
    "Marriage.Neutral_8": "I always wonder, what would life be like if you never visited the tower? Would you be married to someone else?$6#$e#I shudder at the thought.$8",
    "Marriage.Neutral_9": "Sometimes I wonder if [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] is lonely now that I'm gone. That tower got real quiet when no one else was in it.$6",
    "Marriage.Bad_0": "Hey, sorry if I seem distracted. There's a lot on my mind. Work stuff, per usual.$3",
    "Marriage.Bad_1": "I think I need to take a walk or something. I feel like I've been cooped up for too long.$6",
    "Marriage.Bad_2": "Oh, it's you. I've been thinking of spending a few nights at the tower.$3#$b#I just... I have a lot to do.$6",
    "Marriage.Bad_3": "[LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] said [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]'s concerned that our marriage has been distracting me more than usual recently. I mean... Maybe.$3",
    "Marriage.Bad_4": "I want to be alone tonight. I'll be up late in my study. No need to wait up for me in bed.$3",
    "Marriage.Bad_5": "I've been feeling so tired and stressed lately. I haven't felt like this in a long time. It's a very dark place to be in again.$2",
    "Marriage.Bad_6": "Do you still love me..? You've been so cold lately...$2",
    "Marriage.Bad_7": "@? Have you been ignoring me on purpose?$5",
    "Marriage.Bad_8": "I think I made a mistake getting married. It wasn't what I was expecting, to be honest.$6",
    "Marriage.Bad_9": "My mom called today. She's worried that this marriage has been draining me for more than it's worth.$6#$e#What? I just told her how I've been feeling.$3",
    "Marriage.spring_1": "Happy new year, my love. I look forward to what this one will bring for us!$1#$b#That said... I have something for you. It took a lot of work to find, so I hope it helps you for the coming year.[74]#$e#I love you.$9",
    "Marriage.spring_8": "It's been a productive week for you so far, hasn't it?#$b#I'll always be here to do your bidding after a long day of physical labor. Just tell me what you need, and I'll make it happen.",
    "Marriage.spring_23": "Are you going to ask me to dance tomorrow?$6#$b#Please... Not the jumpsuit... I'm begging!$8",
    "Marriage.summer_1": "When did it get so green outside? I feel like I blinked, and it changed seasons.",
    "Marriage.summer_8": "It'd be impossible to fall asleep without a fan in this heat. It'd feel like suffocation without any airflow!",
    "Marriage.summer_15": "Wanna go for a swim? There's the river, the mountain lake, the beach... Take your pick.#$b#I haven't seen you in a swimsuit in a while.$9",
    "Marriage.summer_27": "I'm really looking forward to tomorrow's festival. It never gets old, seeing the Lunaloos drift in from the outer sea.#$e#Perhaps we'll see a rare green one, eh?",
    "Marriage.fall_1": "Did you look out the window this morning? The color of the leaves is so vibrant! I just wanna sit on the porch and observe all day.#$e#Would you join me?",
    "Marriage.fall_8": "Winter is quick to approach. I need to check the pipes, insulation, heating system...$6#$b#Wha- Yes, I know how to do those things.$3#$e#...With the help of a spell, or two...$6",
    "Marriage.fall_15": "Have you collected all your items for tomorrow's grange display?#$b#If you need any last minute items, I've got a couple things in mind for shock value.#$e#[LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] keeps some weird stuff in that tower of [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHis].",
    "Marriage.fall_26": "I can give you some hints for the Spirit's Eve maze tomorrow, if you want.#$b#Not fair..?$6#$b#Life isn't fair, my dear. If the other villagers wanted to know its secrets, they could have married me first!#$e#I'm glad it was you, though, out of anybody else.$9",
    "Marriage.winter_1": "Man, the floor is freezing... Guess we'll have to crank up the heat for a while. Let's hope the bill for this month isn't too crazy.",
    "Marriage.winter_7": "Think you'll join the ice fishing contest tomorrow? Or are you gonna let everyone else have a chance to win?#$e#Come on, we both know you'd blow everyone else out of the water.$9",
    "Marriage.winter_16": "It's my mentor's birthday tomorrow. How would [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] react if I bring [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim] a gift..?$6#$e#Ah, screw it. Everyone likes a little something on their special day.",
    "Marriage.winter_28": "I can't believe the new year starts tomorrow. Time really flies when we're in our own little corner of the world.$6#$b#So... What time are we gonna start drinking?#$e#What? It's never too early.$9",
    "Marriage.spring_IvarasWolfgang": "I've been sneezing like crazy today. Must be a lot of pollen floating around.$6",
    "Marriage.summer_IvarasWolfgang": "I'd put my hair half-up to deal with the heat, but...$6#$b#Then I'd look like my father. Ugh...$5",
    "Marriage.fall_IvarasWolfgang": "I've been craving baked goods today. Something about a fall breeze makes me want something sweet.",
    "Marriage.winter_IvarasWolfgang": "I can't wait for winter to end. It gets dark so early now...$2",

    //Wizard dialogue
    "Wizard.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121001": "I cleaned all kinds of green gunk from the ceiling this morning. Is the cauldron getting too hot..?",
    "Wizard.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121002": "You were there the other day, in the forest. I’m certain you overheard Ivaras and my conversation.#$b#How can I get the boy to focus? He seems to be all over the place lately.",
    "Wizard.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121003": "I sense that you and the boy have a connection. Tell me, is it one-sided?#$b#Ivaras does not have the time to mend a broken heart, if it is so. Nor do I.",
    "Wizard.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121004": "@, I am glad you showed up when you did.#$b#I bore witness to a terrible spat the other day. Ivaras and his father... I can't help but feel sympathy for the boy. How terrible that was.#$b#Perhaps I should lighten his workload for these next few days...",
    "Wizard.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121005": "*murmur* Ivaras has been in a great mood lately. Why might that be..?#$b#Ah, @, I did not see you there.#$b#...#$b#Apologies for my silence. I just came to a realization. Are you looking for the boy?",
    "Wizard.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121006": "Selene seems to have a lot more spunk than her male counterpart. I do hope that my critiquing doesn’t warrant a cranial injury... I must be wary of that one.",
    "Wizard.Mon2": "An aroma of roasted coffee hangs within the tower. It is not necessarily a bad thing. Simply new.",
    "Wizard.Mon10": "I sometimes find myself wondering what would have happened if my ex and I had reproduced. I cannot envision that I would have been an adequate parent.",
    "Wizard.Sat4": "Ivaras is progressing well. I understand there is a lot to learn, and it will take a multitude of both time and patience.",
    "Wizard.Sun": "My arcane pursuits shall not cease thanks to the Wolfgang boy.#$b#I suppose I should thank his father, but I'd much rather show Ivaras my recognition.",
    "Wizard.dating_IvarasWolfgang": "The boy tells me your relationship has become romantic in nature. I suppose congratulations are in order?#$b#He has been buzzing about like a bee ever since you gifted him that bouquet.#$b#I was afraid he would lose sight of his apprenticeship, but it seems to have made him all the more determined to succeed.#$e#Thank you for sparking that fire within him.",
    "Wizard.married_IvarasWolfgang": "I can't help but reminisce on my former marriage, seeing you both at the altar.#$b#I am almost certain your joining will be far more fruitful. I am very proud of the young lad, and you, too, dear farmer.#$b#May your life together be prosperous.",
    "Wizard.divorced_IvarasWolfgang": "...Ivaras has moved back in. He is a shell of his former joyful self. Fortunately, I am best suited to console him regarding this matter.#$b#I do not know what happened between you, but I dare not pry. I wish you well; however, I recommend you stay away from the tower.#$b#Ivaras must pull himself together, and he will not be able to lick his wounds in peace unless you give him the space to do so.#$e#Farewell, @.",

    //Sam dialogue
    "Sam.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121005": "Hey, @. That Ivaras guy was pretty chill! How come I never knew he lived around here?",

    //Sebastian dialogue
    "Sebastian.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121005": "Pool was pretty fun the other night. Same time next week?$7#$b#Make sure to pass it on to Ivaras.$7",

    //Abigail dialogue
    "Abigail.eventSeen_IvarasWolfgang_31121005": "The one time I'm late for the Saloon, everyone has the time of their lives without me. What's up with that?$3",

    //Ivaras 2 Heart Event
    "Ivaras2Heart.0": "*mumble mumble*",
    "Ivaras2Heart.1": "Oh, hey, @! I wasn't expecting any visitors today.",
    "Ivaras2Heart.2": "Er... That's not to say I don't want you here, by any means.",
    "Ivaras2Heart.3": "What are you up to?",
    "Ivaras2Heart.4": "Oh, I actually came to see [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName].",
    "Ivaras2Heart.5": "Funny you ask.#$b#I've been brainstorming this recipe for a while, and I think I finally have it down.",
    "Ivaras2Heart.6": "Is that it? Sorry for assuming... [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]] should be back in a moment, if you want to wait here.$6#$b#Um... I guess I can entertain you with this little experiment for now.$3",
    "Ivaras2Heart.7": "You see, coffee sometimes isn't strong enough to keep me awake.$6#$b#I've done a bit of research and come up with a Revitalizing Potion.#$b#The idea behind it is that when drunk, my mind and body will be refreshed, like new!#$b#This is my first ever attempt.$6",
    "Ivaras2Heart.8": "All I have to do is mix these two vials, and the product will be final.",
    "Ivaras2Heart.9": "Are you sure that's safe to drink..?",
    "Ivaras2Heart.10": "Go on, try it out!",
    "Ivaras2Heart.11": "Ah, surely. There are only two... Well, maybe three ingredients that could clash.$9#$b#Don't worry, though, it's all part of a controlled process.",
    "Ivaras2Heart.12": "!!!$8#$b#Wow, okay! I suppose I shouldn't hesitate, then.",
    "Ivaras2Heart.13": "*cough* *cough*",
    "Ivaras2Heart.14": "Are you okay?!",
    "Ivaras2Heart.15": "You're not hurt, are you?!",
    "Ivaras2Heart.16": "Ugh... Yeah, yeah... I'm okay, but my ego is a little bruised...$10",
    "Ivaras2Heart.17": "Physically, no. My ego? A little.$10",
    "Ivaras2Heart.18": "This is embarrassing. I guess this means I'll be sticking with regular coffee from now on.$10#$b#*smacks lips* ...Yuck. The taste isn't great either.$10",
    "Ivaras2Heart.19": "Well, I should clean this up before my mentor returns. Sorry for giving you a fright.",
    "Ivaras2Heart.20": "I'll help you clean up!",
    "Ivaras2Heart.21": "That was actually pretty funny. See ya, rookie.",
    "Ivaras2Heart.22": "Huh? But @, this is my mess...$10#$b#Well, alright, if you insist. Thank you.$10",
    "Ivaras2Heart.23": "Rookie..? I'm not a...$10#$b#Sigh. I guess you're right.$10",

    //Ivaras 4 Heart Event
    "Ivaras4Heart.0": "What was that..?",
    "Ivaras4Heart.1": "Ahem.",
    "Ivaras4Heart.2": "Sorry! I thought I heard something.$8",
    "Ivaras4Heart.3": "Ivaras, my boy, you must focus.#$b#If you are to one day replace me in protecting the valley, your mind must be a fortress of steel.",
    "Ivaras4Heart.4": "Sigh... Don't I know it.$2#$b#Alright, alright, I'm focusing.",
    "Ivaras4Heart.5": "...#$b#...$11",

    //Ivaras 6 Heart Event
    "Ivaras6Heart.0": "And that is why it is imperitive to become well-versed in many manners of study.#$b#There is more to the arcane than-",
    "Ivaras6Heart.1": "Ah. Greetings, young adept.",
    "Ivaras6Heart.2": "@! Hello!$4",
    "Ivaras6Heart.3": "Is there something you need, @?",
    "Ivaras6Heart.4": "I wanted to see if you were free to hang out, actually.",
    "Ivaras6Heart.5": "Nah, I was just leaving. See ya.",
    "Ivaras6Heart.6": "Oh, I see.#$b#I'm in the middle of a lesson right now. Maybe another day, though. I'm sorry you came all this way for nothing...$2",
    "Ivaras6Heart.7": "O-oh. Er...$3#$b#",
    "Ivaras6Heart.8": "Why did you come in then..?",
    "Ivaras6Heart.9": "Well, see you later, I guess.",
    "Ivaras6Heart.10": "Farewell, @.",
    "Ivaras6Heart.11": "We've made good enough progress for the day. We can be finished for now, so long as you continue your work when you return.",
    "Ivaras6Heart.12": "Whoa, for real? You mean it?$8",
    "Ivaras6Heart.13": "Sigh... Yes, child. Go run amok with your farmer friend.",
    "Ivaras6Heart.14": "Wow, alright! I'll be back later this evening, then.#$b#What might you have planned for us, @?$1",
    "Ivaras6Heart.15": "Thank you, for allowing me to go.#$b#I promise I'll study twice as hard upon returning.$1",
    "Ivaras6Heart.16": "I was starry-eyed once, too. May he be wise enough not to make the same mistakes I did.#$b#Adoration is magic in itself. It bewitches you, body and soul. He shall learn in due time.",
    "Ivaras6Heart.17": "Percival is too harsh on that boy. Ivaras must wish to protect the valley for his own reasons, and this may very well be it.",

    //Ivaras 8 Heart Event
    "Ivaras8Heart.0": "Is everything okay?",
    "Ivaras8Heart.1": "What are you doing out here in the rain?",
    "Ivaras8Heart.2": "Hey, @. I didn't think I would cross paths with anybody here.$2",
    "Ivaras8Heart.3": "Hey, @. I didn't think I would cross paths with anybody here.$2",
    "Ivaras8Heart.4": "What's that face for?",
    "Ivaras8Heart.5": "What's going on? You're getting soaked...",
    "Ivaras8Heart.6": "Is something wrong? You seem upset.",
    "Ivaras8Heart.7": "Heh, so are you, I would argue.#$b#Your concern warms my heart, truly.",
    "Ivaras8Heart.8": "...I didn't think you would notice something was off.$3#$b#I probably should have known better, you being you, and all.$6",
    "Ivaras8Heart.9": "Well, @, it's a bit of a long-winded story. I'm honestly out here just to pout. It might not be of interest to you.$2",
    "Ivaras8Heart.10": "It's up to you if you want to hear it.",
    "Ivaras8Heart.11": "I'm sure you have a good reason, Ivaras. I want to know what's wrong.",
    "Ivaras8Heart.12": "I had some errands to run, but I can listen quickly. What's up?",
    "Ivaras8Heart.13": "You're probably right. I've got better things to do than listen to a sob story.",
    "Ivaras8Heart.14": "Really? That's kind of you.#$b#Um... Here it goes, I guess. The reason I'm feeling down is because of...$6#$b#...my father.$3",
    "Ivaras8Heart.15": "Oh, um... I'll make it short, then. I wouldn't want to keep you too long.$3#$b#Er... Here it goes, I guess. The reason I'm feeling down is because of...$6#$b#...my father.$3",
    "Ivaras8Heart.16": "Wow, okay. I didn't know you felt that way.$5#$b#That was harsh, coming from you. I'll spare you the details, @. You can go now.$2",
    "Ivaras8Heart.17": "He's a big figure in the wizarding world.$3#$b#[LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] actually met my father through the Ferngill Republic Ministry of Magic, and long story short, I’ve been tasked with an apprenticeship under [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName].$6#$b#He's getting older, and needs to pass on [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim] knowledge to the next generation.$3#$b#I get it, but...$2#$b#I am now obligated to keep Pelican Town, and the valley, under my protection for the rest of my life.$6#$b#Not by my own choice, either.$3",
    "Ivaras8Heart.18": "Anyway, my Dad paid a visit to the tower today to check on my progress.$3#$b#He... wasn’t happy, to say the least.$2#$b#He said some things, I said worse things... And the cherry on top was that my mentor was there to witness everything.$2#$b#I’m sure [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] thinks differently of me now.$2",
    "Ivaras8Heart.19": "That all sounds so overwhelming. I'm really sorry to hear that, Ivaras.",
    "Ivaras8Heart.20": "Ugh... Your dad sounds like a jerk. Screw that guy!",
    "Ivaras8Heart.21": "It's fine, honestly. Maybe one day things will be different.$2#$b#I'm just glad to have someone like you to vent to.",
    "Ivaras8Heart.22": "Haha! I love your passion. I wish I could be as straight up as you are.$1",
    "Ivaras8Heart.23": "Thank you for listening, @. I feel a lot better now that I've gotten that off my chest.#$b#I need to go back and apologize to my mentor. Feel free to visit me at the tower anytime you wish.#$b#I wanna keep a friend like you close at all times.$4",
    "Ivaras8Heart.24": "And who knows... Maybe I'll be able to stop by the farm one of these days.$9",

    //Ivaras 10 Heart Event
    "Ivaras10Heart.0": "Is it too late to go back to the tower?$6",
    "Ivaras10Heart.1": "Ouch! You have sharp elbows...$8#$b#Alright, alright, I'll stay. For you.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.2": "Welcome in!",
    "Ivaras10Heart.3": "@, I see you've brought a new friend with you.$1#$b#What can I get for both of you tonight?",
    "Ivaras10Heart.4": "Beers all around, eh? Good choice.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.5": "Excuse me! Another one, please.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.6": "Hehe...",
    "Ivaras10Heart.7": "Hey!",
    "Ivaras10Heart.8": "Sup.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.9": "Hey, @! Glad you made it out tonight! Who's that you're with?",
    "Ivaras10Heart.10": "*gulp* Oh, uh, hey. I'm Ivaras.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.11": "Ahh, well, good to meet ya, Ivaras. This here is Seb, and I'm Sam.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.12": "So, uh, Abby's gonna be late tonight, something about homework, or whatever.#$b#But that means we don't have to worry about odd teams. How about a two vs two in pool?#$b#Sam's gonna need someone to carry his weight tonight.$7",
    "Ivaras10Heart.13": "What?! Hey!$5",
    "Ivaras10Heart.14": "Yeah, it's on!",
    "Ivaras10Heart.15": "Eh... I dunno...",
    "Ivaras10Heart.16": "Er... I've never played before, but I'll give it a shot!",
    "Ivaras10Heart.17": "I mean... I've never played before. I'd be willing to give it a try.#$b#How about it, @? Teach me the ropes?$4",
    "Ivaras10Heart.18": "Don't worry. I can be on Sam's team, you can be on @'s. That way it's fair.$7",
    "Ivaras10Heart.19": "Hey, @, before we get any farther, I just wanted to say...$6#$b#Well, I wanted to say thank you for inviting me out tonight.$3#$b#I had a lot of fun with Sam and Seb, and you. I don't think I could have done something like that without having you as the buffer.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.20": "Haha. It's crazy, actually.#$b#When I'm with you, I feel like I can do all sorts of things I normally wouldn't have the confidence to.$4",
    "Ivaras10Heart.21": "Maybe it's the alcohol talking, but... honestly, @, you look divine under the moonlight.$4",
    "Ivaras10Heart.22": "@.$3#$b#To be quite honest, I've been meaning to confess to you for a long time now.$4#$b#This might seem sudden, but... I'm overwhelmed by this feeling, and I can't keep hiding it any longer.$4#$b#I love you, @. More than anything.$4",
    "Ivaras10Heart.23": "Please... can I kiss you?$4",
    "Ivaras10Heart.24": "Ba-dum. Ba-dum. Is that your heartbeat, or his? You can't tell.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.25": "Yes, you can.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.26": "Sorry, I'm not comfortable with that.",
    "Ivaras10Heart.27": "...Thank Yoba.$4",
    "Ivaras10Heart.28": "Oh. I'm sorry, @. I really didn't mean to...$2#$b#Um... I'm gonna go home now. have a good night, okay?$6",

    //Ivaras 14 Heart Event
    "Ivaras14Heart.0": "Dad..? What are you doing here?$8",
    "Ivaras14Heart.1": "...$1#$b#You're five minutes late. Were you not aware of the time, son?",
    "Ivaras14Heart.2": "Ahem.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.3": "Sigh.$1#$b#Hello, Ivaras. And, hello, @. I've heard plenty about you from my daughter, Selene.$2",
    "Ivaras14Heart.4": "Apologies for missing the wedding. I had urgent business to take care of at that time, but that's why I am here now.#$b#I wanted to meet the person my son has decided to devote his precious time to.$2",
    "Ivaras14Heart.5": "Thanks for the warm welcome.$5",
    "Ivaras14Heart.6": "It's nice to meet you, sir.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.7": "I've heard plenty about you, too, sir.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.8": "Hmph. Well-mannered, at least.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.9": "Is that so?$2",
    "Ivaras14Heart.10": "Percival and I have been conversing long before you arrived. Ivaras, there are some matters we wish to discuss with you, and that is why I called you here.#$b#@, you are more than welcome to join the discussion.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.11": "Percival, I will hand you the torch.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.12": "Very well.#$b#I have come to understand, Ivaras, that your priorities have shifted. I am well aware that we have butt heads on more than one occasion.#$b#Because of the fate I have chosen for you, I do not doubt you have resentment toward me. That, I do not care about.$2",
    "Ivaras14Heart.13": "...$2",
    "Ivaras14Heart.14": "However, I find that I am lenient on marriage so long as you continue to work hard.#$b#I think of your mother, Lunette, and how we have found balance while I continue to carry out my duties within the Ministry of Magic.$1#$b#All that to say, you have my blessing in this.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.15": "...That's new.$6#$b#Thanks for admitting that, Dad. @ and I will be no different in that regard.$3",
    "Ivaras14Heart.16": "I'm certain. And, to be transparent, there is one more factor contributing to my leniency.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.17": "Of course there is...",
    "Ivaras14Heart.18": "A promising candidate has stepped up to the plate. Essentially, with the help we have acquired, your workload will be split in half.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.19": "...Selene, you can come out now.$2",
    "Ivaras14Heart.20": "Ta-da! It's me!$3",
    "Ivaras14Heart.21": "Selene?!$8",
    "Ivaras14Heart.22": "Since you've been gone, I quit college and have been studying day and night to become a witch.#$b#Turns out, I picked it up as fast as you did, if not faster!$1",
    "Ivaras14Heart.23": "You quit art school?! I thought you loved your classes...$8",
    "Ivaras14Heart.24": "Meh... in the beginning.#$b#One of the professors critiqued me on something ridiculous, so I threw my project at his head and, uh..$2#$b#...got expelled.$2#$b#I didn't tell you, but only because I wanted to surprise you when I finally convinced Dad to let me do this.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.25": "I never heard the end of it. You two are nothing if not stubborn.$1",
    "Ivaras14Heart.26": "Also, hello, @! You look as radiant as you did during your wedding!$1#$b#I'm so glad Mom and I got to be there for the ceremony.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.27": "To be completely honest, this doesn't feel real. I thought @ and I would be in our own corner of the world for the rest of our lives.$6#$b#Thank you, Selene. For being stubborn.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.28": "That's what sisters are for, aren't they?",
    "Ivaras14Heart.29": "I'll have my work cut out for me. Training two Wolfgang children will age me twice as quickly.",
    "Ivaras14Heart.30": "You don't say...$1",

    //Ivaras Movie Reactions
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.0": "I've heard good things about this movie. Let's see if it lives up to the hype!",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.1": "Aw...He's leaving his friends?",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.2": "That reminded me of a movie we had on disc back at home. Super nostalgic. What did you think?",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.3": "Did the video game come first, or the movie? I forgot to look it up before this.$6",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.4": "Ivaras seems pretty locked in.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.5": "...Was it just me, or was the Prairie King actor kinda hot? Something about a gruff cowboy, man...",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.6": "This is one of the only movies [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] seems to enjoy. I wanna see why [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] likes it so much.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.7": "Wow, what did I just watch? I didn't understand it, but I thought the cinematography was interesting. I'm a sucker for cool shots.#$b#That ending was interesting, though.$6",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.8": "I'm not sure what to expect going into this one. I'm open to figuring it out, though.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.9": "Ivaras' eyebrows are furrowed, and he appears a little skeptical.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.10": "Eh, I tried to give it a shot, but that's gonna be a no from me. What a strange concept.$6",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.11": "Ah, a classic, I see. Usually older movies bore me a bit, but this one must not be too bad if they restored it for modern theaters, right?",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.12": "Your heart! Obviously!",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.13": "I can't believe they left it off on such a cliffhanger.$8#$b#What happened to them? Did they get together, or not? I have so many questions...$6",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.14": "Winter Star movies always seem very hallmark to me. Still... You've invited me out today, and I'm not ever gonna turn you down.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.15": "Ivaras' eyes are a little glazed over. Is he dozing off?",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.16": "Not quite the hallmark I was expecting, but I'm still not much of a fan of Winter Star themed movies.$3#$b#It's cool to get a new perspective on the Stardrop fruit, though.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.17": "Not that you'd ever know this, but I love a good documentary.#$b#Once I turned twenty-one, whenever I was hung over, I'd put one on the TV and eat fast food breakfast. It was a vibe.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.18": "There's a wondrous glint in Ivaras' eye. He seems enlightened.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.19": "Hey, that was great! Stardew Valley mention!$1#$b#Wouldn't it be cool to visit some of those places?",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.20": "Horror is probably my favorite genre. There better be a decent jumpscare or two.",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.21": "I can't believe this was filmed in my hometown. Freaky!$8",
    "IvarasWolfgang.Movies.22": "That was right up my alley. Gotta love a good camcorder film!#$b#I'll have to tell my sister about this one. She's gonna flip when she hears it was filmed in Grampleton.$1",

    //Ivaras Festival Dialogue
    "EggFestival.IvarasWolfgang_spouse": "It's nice to see everyone out and about. I love spending time alone with you, but I also enjoy people-watching, too.#$e#I'm looking forward to watching you win. Don't go easy on those kids, now.$1",
    "EggFestival.IvarasWolfgang_spouse_y2": "Sam insisted I hang out with him and the others boys today. You don't mind, do you?#$e#Pierre is selling strawberry seeds at his booth, you know. I heard those could run a profit in large quantities. And yes, I did learn that from you.$9#$e#I'm sure there's an abundance of farming knowledge I have yet to acquire. You'll teach me, won't you?",
    "FlowerDance.IvarasWolfgang": "Hi, @. [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] sent me down to keep an eye on things. I'm not entirely sure why, though...#$e#...[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]]'s right behind me, isn't [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]?$8",
    "FlowerDance.IvarasWolfgang_y2": "I've been wandering back and forth between this spot and the snack table.#$b#I need you to hold me back... I'll be ten pounds heavier when I leave this joint.",
    "FlowerDance.IvarasWolfgang_spouse": "Hey, love. I saw you eyeballing me from afar. Don't tell me you've come over here to ask me a question...",
    "FlowerDance.IvarasWolfgang_spouse_y2": "There was supposed to be inclement weather today, but lucky for everyone here, I did a little rain-rain-go-away type ritual this morning.#$b#You can thank me later, when we’re home alone.$9",
    "Luau.IvarasWolfgang_spouse": "I can get down with this kinda festival. I. Am. Stuffed!$1#$e#I brought [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] a plate of things I thought [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe]'d like. And a glass of wine.#$e#I'm the best apprentice, aren't I?$9",
    "Luau.IvarasWolfgang_spouse_y2": "Have you heard of Solarian Chronicles?!$8#$b#Sebastian was just telling me about the campaign he played as a wizard. Some elements are a little off the mark, but...#$b#It could be fun to play someday. Even if their version of wizards wear pointy hats and weild sceptors of glittering orbs.$1",
    "MoonlightJellies.IvarasWolfgang": "[LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] is hiding somewhere in the back, did you see [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim]? I told [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim] [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] should get closer, but [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] seemed pretty adamant about staying where [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] was.",
    "MoonlightJellies.IvarasWolfgang_y2": "I have a feeling you’ll be graced by the presence of the rare green Lunaloo tonight.#$b#You have a magnetic essence, and magical creatures seem to flock to you everywhere you go.#$e#I’m beginning to understand why.$4",
    "MoonlightJellies.IvarasWolfgang_spouse": "Honey! I'm glad you're here. There is absolutely no one else I'd rather spend tonight with.$4",
    "MoonlightJellies.IvarasWolfgang_spouse_y2": "The excitement of this evening is practically tangible. Tonight’s events always remind me to appreciate special moments as they come, and I am especially mindful of this when I spend time with you.",
    "StardewValleyFair.IvarasWolfgang": "[LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] brought me along to meet Welwick. I want to ask her to tell me my future, but what if I don’t like what I hear?$6",
    "StardewValleyFair.IvarasWolfgang_y2": "I asked Welwick if I could try my hand at pondering the orb, but she doesn’t let anyone else touch it, apparently. Maybe next year I can break her down.",
    "StardewValleyFair.IvarasWolfgang_spouse": "Why don't you get your fortune told this year? Welwick is really good...#$b#Before we got together, she predicted that my life would take a drastic turn for the better. Lo and behold, she was completely correct.$9",
    "StardewValleyFair.IvarasWolfgang_spouse_y2": "I might try my hand at spinning that wheel over there. But I’m afraid that if I start, I won’t be able to stop...$6#$e#Most gamblers quit right before they hit the jackpot, you know.$9.",
    "SpiritsEve.IvarasWolfgang": "@! I sensed your presence the moment you entered the maze.#$b#I knew you could do it. Here, I've got a little something extra just for you. Don't tell [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName].$9[279]#$e#I've been tasked with keeping the monsters spellbound within the maze. Can't risk anybody getting hurt. Don't worry, you're in safe hands.",
    "SpiritsEve.IvarasWolfgang_y2": "Wow, look at you, speedy. Nothing will stop you from winning, huh?$9#$b#I will admit, that's something I admire that about you.#$b#...What? Why are you looking at me so expectantly?$3#$b#Alright, alright. Happy Spirit's Eve.$9[PurpleBook]",
    "SpiritsEve.IvarasWolfgang_spouse": "Boo!$8#$b#Aw, come on... You're not scared? I was waiting all night for that.#$b#Hey, now that I think about it, no one can see us back here...$4",
    "IceFestival.IvarasWolfgang": "Everybody's out today. I'll probably just keep chatting with {{Merchant}} and distract her from her shop.",
    "IceFestival.IvarasWolfgang_y2": "The ice statues over there are very impressive. How do you practice something like that when ice is only present during one season? Astounding.",
    "IceFestival.IvarasWolfgang_spouse": "You look chilly, love. Do you want my robe? I'll be fine without it.",
    "IceFestival.IvarasWolfgang_spouse_y2": "Are your hands cold? I can warm them up for you. Here, give them to me.",
    "Christmas.IvarasWolfgang_spouse": "I'm not here for the gifts, rather, the camaraderie of the occasion.#$b#I'm grateful I get to spend this holiday season with you, my love. You'll be the only one I shower with presents this year.$4#$e#Think about it: the less I spend on others, the more I can spend on you. And I think it's well-derserved.$9",
    "Christmas.IvarasWolfgang_spouse_y2": "It's really sweet that everyone is with their families today. It's easy to forget what the spirit of these things are for.#$b#Maybe next year I can take you to my family's home in Grampleton. Every year, we get a tree that is triple our heights and spend a day decorating it together.#$e#I would love for you to get to experience it.$1",

    //Ivaras Schedule Strings
    "ScheduleStrings.Coffee.000": "Don't talk to me before I've had my coffee.$3#$b#Just kidding.$1",
    "ScheduleStrings.Meditating.000": "%You probably shouldn't distract him right now.",
    "ScheduleStrings.TravelingCart.000": "Hey, @. I'll be here catching up with {{Merchant}} for a while. She's good friends with my mom, believe it or not.",
    "ScheduleStrings.Elementals.000": "Sorry, @, I can't talk right now. I'm learning to commune with the elementals.",
    "ScheduleStrings.TowerVisit.000": "Hi, hun. I would have walked you here had I known you were also gonna be stopping by.",
    "ScheduleStrings.Mountain.000": "I figured I'd take the long way into town today, I'm just loitering here for a bit.$9",
    "ScheduleStrings.Pool.000": "My skills improve each time I come here. Pretty soon, I won't need pointers anymore.$9",
    "ScheduleStrings.WizardBirthday.000": "Hey! I just wanted to surprise [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasName] with a visit on [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHim] birthday.#$b#I know [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] doesn't like to celebrate, but I think [LocalizedText Strings/starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve:RomRasGenderHe] should be more excited. You only get so many, after all.",
    "ScheduleStrings.NightMarket.000": "*slurp* The coffee here is pretty good, did you get some? It's free!",

    //Ivaras Room Messages
    "IvarasRoomLetter.1": "Hey Ives!^I hope you’ve gotten settled into your new home. It’s so quiet here now that you’re gone. Mom’s still sad about the whole thing, but it’s not like you died or something. You’re just a train ride away!^Dad, on the other hand... He’s already made your old room into an office. Don’t worry, I’ve been giving him a hard time about it. I want you to have somewhere to sleep when you visit us. Life’s not the same without you.^Miss you!^Selene",
    "IvarasRoom.1": "There seem to be history books on Dwarves and Shadowpeople. You skim over something about a Thousand-Year War.",
    "IvarasRoom.2": "There's a few graphic novels shoved in the back of this shelf. There's no dust on them, so they must still get read frequently enough.",
    "IvarasRoom.3": "There's melatonin and a pair of glasses in here. It's like rooting through Grandpa's nightstand...",
    "IvarasRoom.4": "The bookshelf is right there... Why is this on the ground?",
    "IvarasRoom.5": "'The Curious Occurance of the Prismatic Moon'",
    "IvarasRoom.6": "'The Ferngill Republic Ministry of Magic Directory'",
    "IvarasRoom.7": "Ivaras seems to take good care of these plants. They all are vibrantly green and the leaves are lightly misted.",
    "IvarasRoom.8": "Various herbs and papers with glyphs are strewn about within the drawer. Better to keep this mess contained.",

    //Ivaras Spouse Room Messages
    "IvarasSpouseRoom.1": "Manga and comics share a decent chunk of the shelf.",
    "IvarasSpouseRoom.2": "There are some books here that he brought over from the tower. Many of the titles are unfamiliar to you.",
    "IvarasSpouseRoom.3": "Ah... The same messy drawers as before. Maybe one day you can organize this for him.",

    //Dynamic Strings for Romanceable Rasmodia by Nom0ri
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.His.true": "hers",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.His.false": "his",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.Him.true": "her",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.Him.false": "him",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.He.true": "she",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.He.false": "he",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.Himself.true": "herself",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.Himself.false": "himself",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.Man.true": "lady",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Gender.Man.false": "man",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Name.true": "Rasmodia",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Name.false": "Rasmodius",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Title.true": "witch",
    "starfyzz.ivaraswolfgangsve.RomRas.Title.false": "wizard",

    //Happy Birthday Mod by Omegasis
    "Ivaras.Omegasis.HappyBirthday_BelatedBirthdayWish_IvarasWolfgang": "Dear, @,^^Sources told me that yesterday was your birthday!^^I do apologize for not being able to make it out to the farm to wish it you in person. However, I look forward to when I can see you next, and you can tell me all about how your special day went.^^I hope it was everything you wanted.<^^Very truly yours,^Ivaras%item id 279 1%%[letterbg 2]",
    "Ivaras.Omegasis.HappyBirthday.BirthdayGreeting": "Hmm... something seems different about you today.$3#$b#Could it be that you've gained a new wrinkle?$8#$b#I'm only joking. Happy birthday, @. I am so very happy I got to see you on this special day of yours.$9",
    "Ivaras.SpouseBirthdayEvent_IvarasWolfgang_3": "Say... what kind of gifts do you prefer to receive?",

    //Coffee Roaster Mod by Harrison Grey
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey.CoffeeBlend": "Oh? What's this?$8#$b#*sniff* Wow, that's a lovely aroma. This is great, thank you!$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey.CupSummer": "Whatcha got there?#$b#Calico Roast..? This one's got a bit of a spice to it, I see. I can't wait to try it!$9",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey.CupSpring": "Light roasts are great, in my opinion. It doesn't take as much cream to wash away the bitterness.#$b#Thank you for this. I'll let you know how it tastes!",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey.CupFall": "Oh, wow, what a nice surprise! How'd you know I like hazelnut coffee?$9#$b#Sounds like it was a lucky guess. Thank you, @.$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey.CupWinter": "Made with Crystalfruit... Oh, I've had those before. I often see them around during my strolls around the forest.#$b#I'm looking forward to brewing this!$1",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey.CupPumpkin": "I smelled it as soon as you walked in. Pumpkin spice is unmistakable!#$b#*slurp*Ugh... So good. Thanks for this. I appreciate you making the trek, just for me.$4",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey.Matcha": "I've actually never tried matcha before. There's a specific process for making it into a drink, right?$6#$b#I'll do some research. Maybe you can come to the tower and try it with me, when I master the technique.",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey": "Whatcha got there?#$b#Calico Roast..? This one's got a bit of a spice to it, I see. I can't wait to try it!$9",
    "Ivaras.AcceptGift(O)HarrisonGrey.GreenTeaLatte": "This looks like a potion I brewed-#$b#Well, tried to brew, a few days ago. That cauldron has something against me, I swear...$6#$b#I hope this one tastes better!",

    //Birthday Redux Reworked Mod by boxosoup
    "boxosoup.birthday_birthday": "Happiest of birthdays, @. I'm ecstatic to be able to celebrate with you on this lovely day!$1#$b#I'm not the best at baking, however, my mother has quite the knack for it.#$b#I made a trip to Grampleton to pick up a cake for you. She made it early this morning, so it's still quite fresh. I sincerely hope you enjoy it.[220]",
}